  <name>DevProjex</name>
  <summary>Build AI context from codebases</summary>
  <description>
    <p>DevProjex turns a folder or Git repository into clean, ready-to-use context for AI chats, code review, and documentation. Choose files in an interactive tree, inspect the result, and export the project structure and content.</p>
    <p>The same engine is available through a graphical desktop app, a terminal interface, direct command-line commands, and a built-in MCP server.</p>
    <p>Opened source projects stay read-only and processing remains local. Secret redaction can mask detected credentials, while optional private-data redaction covers personal traces such as email addresses and local user paths.</p>
  </description>
